{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Words fade, but traces on paper remain forever.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a narrative puzzle game that combines hidden object searches with healing-style scrapbook collage at its core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a girl who has lost her ability to speak, embarking on a journey to collect fragments of her memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Core Gameplay: Hidden Object Search<br>The heart of the game lies in finding designated hidden items within intricately designed scenes. Whether it's a cluttered attic, among falling flower petals, or in a quiet corner of a desk, you'll need to observe carefully to uncover key &quot;pieces of life&quot; that drive the story forward. Every item you discover is an important clue that helps piece together the complete narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Special Feature: Scrapbook Collage<br>Searching isn't just about collecting\u2014it's also about creating. Found items are transformed into uniquely styled decorative stickers. You can freely arrange these stickers on blank pages, crafting a personalized album filled with memories and growth. Use your creativity and aesthetic sense to document this healing journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Game Highlights<br>Pure Hidden Object Experience: Explore a wealth of hand-drawn scenes and discover dozens of hidden items.<br>Narrative-Driven Exploration: Behind every object lies a fragment of a story\u2014searching is part of the puzzle.<br>Emotional Reward System: Through scrapbooking, the process of finding objects brings a deep sense of accomplishment and healing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Piece together your own story.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656760/extras/82d9de101b6245f96b2a660c0f58b835.poster.avif?t=1773774646\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656760/extras/82d9de101b6245f96b2a660c0f58b835.webm?t=1773774646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656760/extras/82d9de101b6245f96b2a660c0f58b835.mp4?t=1773774646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Search for puzzle fragments across different worlds.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656760/extras/93d84efc4d4e4207f9339f22e3d639c9.poster.avif?t=1773774646\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656760/extras/93d84efc4d4e4207f9339f22e3d639c9.webm?t=1773774646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656760/extras/93d84efc4d4e4207f9339f22e3d639c9.mp4?t=1773774646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656760/extras/01de70e12b06e69781f8d6800068ead8.poster.avif?t=1773774646\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656760/extras/01de70e12b06e69781f8d6800068ead8.webm?t=1773774646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656760/extras/01de70e12b06e69781f8d6800068ead8.mp4?t=1773774646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656760/extras/36e18696c5a2522fea33cf7ab978f0fc.